 { "The plate scale is 0.4 arcsec/pixel in the spatial direction.": "In the spatial direction the plate scale is 0.4 arcsec/pixel." },
 { "The instrument is read-noise limited shortward of 2.5µm and background-limited longward of 3µm.": "The instrument is read-noise limited shortward of 2.5µm and background-limited longward of 3µm." },
